没错，选自《雅歌》。

761
00:36:44.460 --> 00:36:45.580
We had a fan question.
我们收到一个粉丝提问。

762
00:36:45.840 --> 00:36:46.140
Okay.
好的。

763
00:36:46.660 --> 00:36:47.760
From Stephanie C.
来自宾夕法尼亚州匹兹堡的斯蒂芬妮·C。

764
00:36:47.920 --> 00:36:49.060
in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania.
宾夕法尼亚州匹兹堡的。

765
00:36:49.320 --> 00:36:51.580
What is this timeline for wedding guests?
婚礼宾客的时间线到底是怎么回事？

766
00:36:51.580 --> 00:36:56.040
First of all, Dwight and Kevin just buried the hatchet yesterday.
首先，德怀特和凯文昨天才刚刚言归于好。

767
00:36:56.740 --> 00:36:59.920
And now he's not only at the wedding, but he's a reader?
现在他不仅参加了婚礼，还是读经人？

768
00:37:01.140 --> 00:37:04.260
And Angela had Kevin read at her wedding?
而且安吉拉竟然让凯文在她的婚礼上读经？

769
00:37:04.920 --> 00:37:11.100
Then Erin just met her parents this morning, and now they're at the wedding of her co-workers?
还有，艾琳今天早上才刚见到她的父母，现在他们就出现在她同事的婚礼上了？

770
00:37:11.600 --> 00:37:18.560
Not only are these people extremely flexible with their day, but Angela and Dwight are extremely flexible with their wedding plans.
这些人不仅对自己的日程安排极其灵活，安吉拉和德怀特的婚礼计划也极其灵活。

771
00:37:18.560 --> 00:37:23.880
I'm sorry, but as head of the PPC, I'm surprised she would allow for these last-minute changes.
抱歉，但作为派对策划委员会的负责人，我很惊讶她竟然允许这些临时变动。

772
00:37:24.220 --> 00:37:25.400
I don't disagree.
我表示赞同。

773
00:37:26.080 --> 00:37:26.820
All right.
好吧。

774
00:37:27.060 --> 00:37:29.920
We also have a bulls**t card from Annette G.
我们还收到一张来自澳大利亚纽卡斯尔的安妮特·G寄来的“胡扯”卡片。

775
00:37:30.080 --> 00:37:32.720
in Newcastle, Australia, who said,
澳大利亚纽卡斯尔的，她说，

776
00:37:32.940 --> 00:37:34.180
I call bulls**t.
我说是胡扯。

777
00:37:34.560 --> 00:37:41.520
They took time to introduce Dwight's siblings on the farm only for them to disappear from the show and not even attend the wedding?
他们花时间在农场介绍了德怀特的兄弟姐妹，结果他们后来就从剧里消失了，甚至连婚礼都没参加？

778
00:37:42.100 --> 00:37:48.160
In the farm, and I know it was created with the intention of being a pilot, but it was still an episode in the office,
在《农场》那一集里——我知道那是作为试播集创作的，但它依然是《办公室》的一集——

779
00:37:48.360 --> 00:37:54.520
they showed this bond between Dwight and his siblings and nephew only for none of them to be at his wedding?
他们展示了德怀特与他兄弟姐妹及侄子之间的羁绊，结果他们谁都没去参加他的婚礼？

780
00:37:54.720 --> 00:37:56.460
I so agree with this.
我太同意这一点了。

781
00:37:56.620 --> 00:37:57.560
Where is his brother?
他哥哥去哪了？

782
00:37:57.780 --> 00:38:01.840
Where is his sister and his cute little nephew who he taught how to milk?
他姐姐还有那个他教过挤奶的可爱小侄子去哪了？

783
00:38:02.260 --> 00:38:02.740
Yes.
没错。

784
00:38:03.100 --> 00:38:06.060
I see that bulls**t card, and I raise it.
我收下这张“胡扯”卡，并加码。

785
00:38:06.220 --> 00:38:07.600
What do you raise it to?
你要加码到什么程度？

786
00:38:07.860 --> 00:38:08.840
Super bulls**t.
超级胡扯。

787
00:38:10.680 --> 00:38:12.540
Okay, good.
好的，很好。

788
00:38:13.240 --> 00:38:15.200
Well, people had more things to say.
嗯，大家还有别的话要说。

789
00:38:15.420 --> 00:38:15.900
Cora C.
马萨诸塞州东汉普顿的科拉·C说，

790
00:38:16.020 --> 00:38:18.020
in East Hampton, Massachusetts said,
马萨诸塞州东汉普顿的，她说，

791
00:38:18.220 --> 00:38:20.880
This bothers me every time I watch this episode.
每次看这一集我都觉得很困扰。

792
00:38:20.880 --> 00:38:23.020
