00:49:36.810 --> 00:49:41.690
It just seems so strange and a little sad that we see so many cameos at the end of the show.
剧集结尾出现了那么多客串角色，唯独少了迈克尔的一生挚爱，这看起来太奇怪也太令人难过了。

1073
00:49:41.830 --> 00:49:43.750
But the love of Michael's life is gone.
请解释一下。

1074
00:49:43.970 --> 00:49:44.950
Please explain.
请解释一下。

1075
00:49:46.190 --> 00:49:48.750
Summer, it was a scheduling conflict.
萨默，确实是档期冲突。

1076
00:49:48.750 --> 00:49:56.650
It was originally intended for Holly to also come to the wedding and also bring their kids.
原本的计划是让霍莉也参加婚礼，并带上他们的孩子。

1077
00:49:57.630 --> 00:50:01.290
But Amy Ryan was not available on these dates.
但艾米·瑞恩在拍摄期间没空。

1078
00:50:02.090 --> 00:50:07.590
There was a talking head that was scripted for Holly.
原本还为霍莉写了一段采访戏份。

1079
00:50:07.810 --> 00:50:12.650
And she was going to be holding their children, some Irish twins.
她本该抱着他们的孩子，一对年龄相近的兄弟。

1080
00:50:13.690 --> 00:50:14.830
Elizabeth P.
来自加拿大安大略省多伦多的伊丽莎白·P。

1081
00:50:15.030 --> 00:50:16.310
from Toronto, Canada said,
问道，

1082
00:50:16.310 --> 00:50:18.770
We find out that Michael has a few kids with Holly.
我们得知迈克尔和霍莉有几个孩子。

1083
00:50:19.090 --> 00:50:21.870
Does this mean he got his third vasectomy reversed?
这是否意味着他做了第三次输精管结扎复通手术？

1084
00:50:22.430 --> 00:50:23.890
Snip, snap, snip, snap.
咔嚓，接上，咔嚓，接上。

1085
00:50:24.130 --> 00:50:24.950
Snip, snap.
咔嚓，接上。

1086
00:50:25.570 --> 00:50:28.210
And also a fan question from Ivana O.
还有一个来自科罗拉多州奥罗拉的伊凡娜·O的粉丝提问，

1087
00:50:28.410 --> 00:50:30.210
in Aurora, Colorado, who said,
她说，

1088
00:50:30.450 --> 00:50:32.830
I'm dying to know what Michael named his kids.
我太想知道迈克尔给孩子们取了什么名字了。

1089
00:50:33.350 --> 00:50:37.110
Is there anything in the show Bible or deleted scenes that tell us this?
剧本大纲或删减片段里有提到吗？

1090
00:50:37.530 --> 00:50:38.370
There is.
有的。

1091
00:50:39.410 --> 00:50:40.530
Holly's talking head.
是霍莉的采访戏份。

1092
00:50:41.110 --> 00:50:41.890
That's right.
没错。

1093
00:50:42.070 --> 00:50:42.610
Read it, Jenna.
读一下吧，珍娜。

1094
00:50:43.090 --> 00:50:43.990
It says,
上面写着，

1095
00:50:43.990 --> 00:50:50.510
Holly was going to have this talking head while Dwight and Michael were dancing together in the background to Rosalita.
这段采访本该在德怀特和迈克尔在背景里随着《罗莎莉塔》跳舞时出现。

1096
00:50:50.730 --> 00:50:52.350
So we see this happen.
所以我们看到了那一幕。

1097
00:50:52.530 --> 00:50:54.670
But that's where this talking head would have been.
但那本该是这段采访出现的地方。

1098
00:50:54.790 --> 00:50:55.750
And Holly says this,
霍莉是这么说的，

1099
00:50:56.170 --> 00:50:57.010
Life is good.
生活很美好。

1100
00:50:57.230 --> 00:50:58.590
We have two sons,
我们有两个儿子，

1101
00:50:59.630 --> 00:51:01.390
Chebensher and Loshabin.
切本舍和洛沙宾。

1102
00:51:02.310 --> 00:51:03.470
Michael named them.
是迈克尔给它们起的名字。

1103
00:51:03.950 --> 00:51:07.390
He said it was based on the feeling he had when he first saw them.
他说这是基于他第一次见到它们时的感觉。

1104
00:51:08.550 --> 00:51:10.750
Then we were going to see the kids dancing.
然后我们去看孩子们跳舞。

1105
00:51:11.830 --> 00:51:12.470
Chebensher?
切本舍？

1106
00:51:13.430 --> 00:51:14.070
Chebensher.
切本舍。

1107
00:51:14.290 --> 00:51:15.330
And Loshabin.
还有洛沙宾。

1108
00:51:15.530 --> 00:51:17.710
How do you spell Chebensher?
切本舍怎么拼？

1109
00:51:18.030 --> 00:51:21.950
C-H-E-B-O-N-S-H-U-R.
C-H-E-B-O-N-S-H-U-R。

1110
00:51:23.190 --> 00:51:23.830
Chebensher.
切本舍。

1111
00:51:24.190 --> 00:51:25.610
And Loshabin.
还有洛沙宾。

1112
00:51:25.810 --> 00:51:28.510
L-O-W-S-H-E-B-I-N.
L-O-W-S-H-E-B-I-N。

1113
00:51:28.870 --> 00:51:32.990
Well, when they go to Disneyland and everyone else can find a magnet with their name on it,
好吧，当他们去迪士尼乐园，别人都能找到刻有自己名字的磁铁时，

1114
00:51:33.030 --> 00:51:34.730
they're not going to be able to.
他们却找不到。

1115
00:51:34.950 --> 00:51:35.590
They will not.
确实找不到。

1116
00:51:36.130 --> 00:51:40.350
But, you know, it made sense to me that just Michael came to the wedding.
不过，你知道，迈克尔一个人来参加婚礼对我来说很合理。

1117
00:51:40.590 --> 00:51:44.750
I mean, when you have young kids, if you don't have child care, one of you stays home.
我是说，当你有了年幼的孩子，如果没有人照看，你们其中一人就得留在家。

1118
00:51:44.910 --> 00:51:48.930
You kind of have to divide up these events and say, who can go to what?
你得把这些活动分摊开来，商量谁去参加哪个。

1119
00:51:49.110 --> 00:51:50.110
Can someone watch the kids?
有人能看孩子吗？

1120
00:51:50.210 --> 00:51:52.650
And if they can't, one of you goes and one of you doesn't.
如果不行，你们就只能去一个人。

1121
00:51:52.790 --> 00:51:52.930
Yeah.
是啊。

1122
00:51:52.930 --> 00:51:54.410
So that made sense to me.
所以这对我来说很合理。

1123
00:51:54.570 --> 00:51:55.710
It made sense to me, too.
对我来说也一样。

1124
00:51:56.210 --> 00:51:58.970
Well, now we have a montage of people dancing.
好了，现在我们来看一段人们跳舞的剪辑。

1125
00:51:59.390 --> 00:52:02.730
First up are Erin and her father, and they dance just the same.
首先是艾琳和她父亲，他们跳舞的样子简直一模一样。

1126
00:52:02.970 --> 00:52:03.730
So sweet.
太甜了。

1127
00:52:03.890 --> 00:52:04.450
So sweet.
太甜了。

1128
00:52:04.830 --> 00:52:09.090
Now Toby and Pam dance together, and Toby just sobs the whole time.
现在托比和帕姆一起跳舞，托比全程都在啜泣。

1129
00:52:09.430 --> 00:52:10.830
Yes, he's very sad.
是的，他非常难过。

1130
00:52:11.030 --> 00:52:12.530
Pam's like, is it me?
帕姆心想，是因为我吗？

1131
00:52:12.790 --> 00:52:13.670
Is it Nellie?
还是因为奈莉？

1132
00:52:13.850 --> 00:52:15.670
And he's like, it's everything.
而他却说，是因为这一切。

1133
00:52:16.490 --> 00:52:16.930
Toby.
托比啊。

1134
00:52:17.250 --> 00:52:17.710
You know what?
你知道吗？

1135
00:52:17.710 --> 00:52:20.230
I'm glad we had that because that also happens at weddings.
我很高兴我们拍到了这一幕，因为婚礼上确实会发生这种事。

1136
00:52:20.230 --> 00:52:21.190
That's what I was going to say.
我正想说这个。

1137
00:52:21.190 --> 00:52:23.570
There's always some person who is just weepy.
总会有那么一个人哭哭啼啼的。

1138
00:52:23.950 --> 00:52:24.130
Yep.
没错。

1139
00:52:24.970 --> 00:52:27.230
Now Phyllis and Stanley dance together.
现在菲利斯和斯坦利一起跳舞。

1140
00:52:27.490 --> 00:52:28.530
This is so cute.
这太可爱了。

1141
00:52:28.770 --> 00:52:30.070
Phyllis says, I missed you.
菲利斯说，我想你了。

1142
00:52:30.210 --> 00:52:31.590
Stanley says, I missed you, too.
斯坦利说，我也想你了。

1143
00:52:31.850 --> 00:52:34.210
And then Phyllis has the sweetest talking head.
然后菲利斯有一段非常温馨的采访。

1144
00:52:34.390 --> 00:52:38.830
She's crying real tears here because we were all getting pretty sad.
她在这里流下了真诚的泪水，因为我们当时都感到非常伤感。

1145
00:52:39.130 --> 00:52:46.770
With each passing day as we filmed the finale, it got just more and more real that we were saying goodbye to the show.
随着拍摄大结局的日子一天天过去，我们即将告别这部剧的感觉变得越来越真实。

1146
00:52:47.110 --> 00:52:47.290
Yeah.
是啊。

1147
00:52:47.290 --> 00:52:55.490
Phyllis has a talking head where she says people think that Stanley is a mean old grump, but would a mean old grump make this statue of her?
菲利斯在采访中说，人们觉得斯坦利是个刻薄的老古怪，但一个刻薄的老古怪会为她雕刻这座雕像吗？

1148
00:52:55.730 --> 00:52:58.570
And it's like Phyllis, because he told us he carves birds.
那看起来很像菲利斯，因为他告诉过我们他会雕刻鸟类。

1149
00:52:58.690 --> 00:52:58.850
Yeah.
是啊。

1150
00:52:59.110 --> 00:53:01.610
Now he's carved Phyllis as a bird.
现在他把菲利斯雕刻成了一只鸟。

1151
00:53:01.890 --> 00:53:02.050
Yeah.
是啊。

1152
00:53:02.170 --> 00:53:05.310
The top half is Phyllis, and then her legs are like bird legs.
上半身是菲利斯，然后她的腿就像鸟腿一样。

1153
00:53:05.390 --> 00:53:06.710
It's so cute.
太可爱了。

1154
00:53:07.010 --> 00:53:09.190
I have a secret about this talking head.
关于这个访谈片段，我有个秘密。

1155
00:53:09.410 --> 00:53:10.310
What is it?
是什么？

1156
00:53:10.510 --> 00:53:11.950
Phyllis is not at the wedding.
菲利斯其实没去婚礼现场。

1157
00:53:12.830 --> 00:53:21.230
She's in the Dunder Mifflin parking lot with a green screen because the carving wasn't ready when we were up at Big Sky Ranch.
她在邓德·米夫林的停车场里，背景是绿幕，因为我们在大天空牧场拍摄时，那个雕刻还没准备好。

1158
00:53:21.710 --> 00:53:23.330
So they had to pick it up later.
所以他们不得不后来才去取。

1159
00:53:23.710 --> 00:53:25.950
You cannot tell that's a green screen.
你根本看不出那是绿幕。

1160
00:53:26.290 --> 00:53:27.050
That's really well done.
做得真好。

1161
00:53:27.150 --> 00:53:29.630
That's some secret intel from Steve Burgess.
这是来自史蒂夫·伯吉斯的独家情报。

1162
00:53:29.670 --> 00:53:30.910
That's some movie magic.
这就是电影魔法。

1163
00:53:31.510 --> 00:53:38.030
We did get a fan mail flurry of people wanting to know if Phyllis got to keep the bird, and she did.
我们确实收到了一大波粉丝来信，想知道菲利斯有没有留着那只鸟，她确实留下了。

1164
00:53:38.030 --> 00:53:41.190
She said that in her interview with us, that she kept this.
她在接受我们采访时说了，她留下了这个。

1165
00:53:41.470 --> 00:53:45.310
I texted with her because I don't think we knew where she keeps it.
我给她发了短信，因为我觉得我们不知道她把它放在哪儿了。

1166
00:53:45.410 --> 00:53:47.070
She said she keeps it in her home office.
她说她把它放在家庭办公室里。

1167
00:53:47.710 --> 00:53:52.350
So she does not have her bushiest beaver dundee, but she does have the bird carving.
所以她虽然没有她那座最毛茸茸的海狸邓迪奖杯，但她确实有那个鸟雕刻。

1168
00:53:52.750 --> 00:53:54.050
Well, I'm glad she has it.
嗯，我很高兴她留着它。

1169
00:53:54.190 --> 00:53:54.570
Me too.
我也是。

1170
00:53:55.350 --> 00:53:57.690
Kelly and Ryan are now going to leave the wedding together.
凯莉和瑞安现在要一起离开婚礼了。

1171
00:53:57.690 --> 00:54:00.350
They're running down the hill to their cars.
他们正跑下山坡去取车。

1172
00:54:00.590 --> 00:54:01.930
Ryan says, I love you.
瑞安说，我爱你。

1173
00:54:02.090 --> 00:54:03.150
Kelly says, I love you too.
凯莉说，我也爱你。

1174
00:54:03.670 --> 00:54:05.290
Ryan says, we're going to be together forever.
瑞安说，我们要永远在一起。

1175
00:54:05.590 --> 00:54:07.570
And Kelly says, we're running off into the sunset.
凯莉说，我们要奔向夕阳了。

1176
00:54:07.950 --> 00:54:10.810
And then Ryan has this line, OMG.
然后瑞安说了这句台词，天哪。

1177
00:54:11.290 --> 00:54:13.050
He says, I finally mastered commitment.
他说，我终于掌握了承诺的真谛。

1178
00:54:13.430 --> 00:54:15.850
As he leaves his own child behind.
与此同时他却把自己的孩子丢在身后。

1179
00:54:15.850 --> 00:54:16.310
Yeah.
是啊。

1180
00:54:16.770 --> 00:54:17.830
He's mastered commitment.
他掌握了承诺的真谛。

1181
00:54:18.050 --> 00:54:20.710
I liked this ending for this pairing.
我喜欢这对组合这样的结局。

1182
00:54:20.970 --> 00:54:21.630
It's perfect.
太完美了。

1183
00:54:21.950 --> 00:54:23.170
It was all in character.
这完全符合角色设定。

1184
00:54:23.470 --> 00:54:24.250
It's so perfect.
真是太完美了。

1185
00:54:24.970 --> 00:54:27.150
Well, the reception is now in full swing.
好了，招待会现在正如火如荼地进行着。

1186
00:54:27.150 --> 00:54:28.950
Dwight and Michael are dancing together.
德怀特和迈克尔正在一起跳舞。

1187
00:54:28.950 --> 00:54:32.270
I loved seeing these two guys having fun on the dance floor.
我喜欢看到这两个家伙在舞池里玩得这么开心。

1188
00:54:32.810 --> 00:54:35.450
Angela and her sister, Rachel, are dancing as well.
安吉拉和她的妹妹瑞秋也在跳舞。

1189
00:54:35.730 --> 00:54:40.250
We improvised what our dance moves would be, and we decided we danced just the same.
我们的舞步是即兴发挥的，我们决定跳得一模一样。

1190
00:54:40.750 --> 00:54:43.730
Also dancing are Meredith and a man.
同样在跳舞的还有梅雷迪斯和一个男人。

1191
00:54:43.950 --> 00:54:44.510
Yes.
没错。

1192
00:54:44.710 --> 00:54:50.330
That man was Kate Flannery's real-life boyfriend and our set photographer, Chris Haston.
那个男人是凯特·弗兰纳里的现实生活中的男友，也是我们的片场摄影师克里斯·哈斯顿。

1193
00:54:50.790 --> 00:54:55.030
Now, later in the warehouse, he's also going to be the photographer who's taking our photo.
后来在仓库里，他也会作为摄影师为我们拍照。

1194
00:54:55.030 --> 00:55:02.670
So I like to imagine that he was the PBS photographer sent to Dwight and Angela's wedding to document
所以我喜欢想象他是PBS派去德怀特和安吉拉婚礼上记录这一切的摄影师，

1195
00:55:02.670 --> 00:55:05.430
things, and we have another wedding hookup.
然后我们又多了一段婚礼邂逅。

1196
00:55:05.450 --> 00:55:06.210
Another wedding hookup.
又一段婚礼邂逅。

1197
00:55:06.370 --> 00:55:09.990
But it mirrors her real-life romance because he was our photographer.
但这恰好映照了她现实生活中的恋情，因为他就是我们的摄影师。

1198
00:55:10.210 --> 00:55:10.830
That's right.
没错。

1199
00:55:11.410 --> 00:55:13.510
We got a fan question from Stephen K.
我们收到了来自新泽西州费尔朗的斯蒂芬·K的粉丝提问，

1200
00:55:13.830 --> 00:55:15.510
in Fairlawn, New Jersey, who said,
他说，

1201
00:55:15.810 --> 00:55:18.370
everybody's dancing to Springsteen's Rosalita.
每个人都在随着斯普林斯汀的《罗莎莉塔》跳舞。

1202
00:55:18.630 --> 00:55:22.230
How was this song decided on, and how much did it cost to get the song?
这首歌是怎么选定的？版权费花了多少钱？

1203
00:55:22.810 --> 00:55:25.810
Well, Steve Burgess said we always wanted to use it.
嗯，史蒂夫·伯吉斯说我们一直想用这首歌。

1204
00:55:25.910 --> 00:55:27.190
It was scripted.
剧本里写了。

1205
00:55:27.310 --> 00:55:29.790
This was in the script, this song's suggestion.
这首歌的建议就在剧本里。

1206
00:55:30.150 --> 00:55:34.390
And Bruce Springsteen's songs are very difficult, if not impossible, to clear.
布鲁斯·斯普林斯汀的歌版权非常难拿，甚至可以说是不可能的。

1207
00:55:34.390 --> 00:55:37.250
So Steve was like, I mean, I'll give it my best shot.
所以史蒂夫当时说，我会尽我所能去争取。

1208
00:55:37.490 --> 00:55:38.850
He said it took a while.
他说花了不少时间。

1209
00:55:39.190 --> 00:55:43.030
We found out that our request went to Bruce himself.
我们后来发现我们的申请直接递到了布鲁斯本人手里。

1210
00:55:43.950 --> 00:55:48.730
He was a fan of The Office and said, you can use the song.
他是《办公室》的粉丝，他说，你们可以用这首歌。

1211
00:55:49.430 --> 00:55:50.870
It costs a lot of money.
这花了很多钱。

1212
00:55:51.090 --> 00:55:52.550
The boss agreed.
老板同意了。

1213
00:55:52.830 --> 00:55:54.090
The boss agreed.
老板同意了。

1214
00:55:54.350 --> 00:55:55.310
What did it cost?
花了多少钱？

1215
00:55:55.450 --> 00:55:56.170
$100,000.
十万美元。

1216
00:55:56.290 --> 00:55:56.630
Oh!
噢！

1217
00:55:57.450 --> 00:55:59.210
So I hope you all enjoy that dance scene.
所以我希望你们都喜欢那场舞蹈戏。

1218
00:55:59.970 --> 00:56:00.530
Wowza.
哇哦。

1219
00:56:01.270 --> 00:56:04.050
Well, Ravi is now going to return with baby Drake,
拉维现在要带着小德雷克回来了，

1220
00:56:04.050 --> 00:56:07.290
and then he learns from Kevin that Kelly and Ryan have left.
然后他从凯文那里得知凯利和瑞安已经离开了。

1221
00:56:07.510 --> 00:56:11.450
And he gives the baby to Kevin, says, call child services.
他把孩子交给凯文，说，打给儿童保护机构吧。

1222
00:56:11.790 --> 00:56:14.370
They'll find someone better to take care of him than Ryan.
他们会找到比瑞安更好的人来照顾他。

1223
